      "content": "ibuprofen?? i thought i shouldn't take that while on eliquis because of the bleeding risk? also, my head is starting to feel pretty nauseous and the headache is getting more intense. if i take the ibuprofen and it makes the nausea worse or if i feel even more dizzy, should i just take more to drown out the pain, or is that when i actually need to call 911?",
